    // corresponding row tree. Re-run the host resize after the next layout
    // turns, but let a newer snapshot cancel older retries so rapid window
    // opens do not restart the panel geometry over and over.
    var workspacePopoverResizeGeneration = 0
    // A new window is not guaranteed to generate an activation notification
    // (for example, an already-active browser opening a second window). Keep
    // the visible workspace popover live at a modest cadence instead of
    // making the five-second background refresh the first chance to notice it.
    var workspacePopoverRefreshTimer: Timer?
